## Summary


## Vulnerability Detail
On this part of [ConvexSpell.closePositionFarm()](https://github.com/sherlock-audit/2023-04-blueberry/blob/main/blueberry-core/contracts/spell/ConvexSpell.sol#L195-L209)
```solidity
            // 4. Remove liquidity
